{"deletions":[],"marks":[],"ops":[{"after":0,"anchor":"summary","cjk":false,"html":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":1},{"after":1,"cjk":false,"html":"<p>修复 Binance OHLC 在 <code>USE_HTTP_PROXY=true</code> 场景下因缺失 <code>requestContext</code> 导致的请求失败问题。<br>通过在 <code>public-api.ts</code> 中新增 <code>getFutureKlines</code> / <code>getSpotKlines</code> wrapper，统一处理 <code>createRequestContext</code>、<code>acquireSync</code> 和 <code>requestPublic</code>，并让 <code>ohlc-service.ts</code> 仅调用该封装入口。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":2},{"after":2,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>同时补充了 Futures Kline 按 <code>limit</code> 分段权重、Spot/Margin 使用统一 spot wrapper（weight=2），并将 OHLC 的 <code>instType</code> 分支改为显式处理 <code>USDT-FUTURE | SPOT | MARGIN</code>，未知类型直接报错。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":3},{"after":3,"anchor":"validation","cjk":false,"html":"<h2 id=\"validation\">Validation</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":4},{"after":4,"cjk":false,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>./node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.json</code>（workdir: <code>apps/vendor-binance</code>）✅</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":5},{"after":5,"cjk":false,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>rush build --to @yuants/vendor-binance</code>（workdir: repo root）✅</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":6},{"after":6,"anchor":"risks","cjk":false,"html":"<h2 id=\"risks\">Risks</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":7},{"after":7,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>当前缺少代理场景的集成测试，真实代理链路仍建议补充端到端验证</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":8},{"after":8,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>public-api</code> 中其他 endpoint 仍有模板重复，后续可继续收敛统一</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":9},{"after":9,"anchor":"rollback","cjk":false,"html":"<h2 id=\"rollback\">Rollback</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":10},{"after":10,"cjk":false,"htm